<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 285 mln rand S.African bonds Fri.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 285 mln rand S.African bonds Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 285.38 million rand's worth of bonds on Friday after selling 746.16 million rand's worth on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
